restore to regenerate an inventory from the local NuGet cache. It also records
the package's bundled license/notice files and hashes without inferring a
license from a package name.

Important distribution conditions:
- Markdig 1.3.2 uses BSD-2-Clause. Its copyright and license are preserved in
  third-party/Markdig.LICENSE.txt and copied into the desktop publish output.
- JsonSchema.Net 9.4.0, JsonPointer.Net 7.0.2 and Json.More.Net 3.0.1 include
  OSMFEULA.txt. Their upstream source is MIT, while the upstream binary release
  carries maintenance-fee terms. Consult the exact package agreement and
  docs/release.md; do not label the downloaded binary package as MIT-only.
- Microsoft.AnalysisServices and Microsoft.AnalysisServices.AdomdClient
  19.118.3 declare separate Microsoft license URLs. Their terms must be
  reviewed for binary redistribution. The source archive contains no such DLLs.
- Test SDK and xUnit packages are development dependencies and are not
  included in the source archive as binaries.

The release script creates a source archive with manifests and dependency
metadata. It does not publish a GitHub release or authorize binary distribution.
